-- Initial SfM point cloud $P = \{p_i\}_{i=1}^N$, where each $p_i$ has a 3D position and color [S1].
-- Multiplier $m$: total number of points generated per original SfM point (including the original) [S1].
-- Radius bounds $\rho_{min}, \rho_{max}$: lower and upper bounds for the sampling disk radius, expressed as fractions of the robust scene radius $R$ [S1].
-- $K_{nn}$: number of nearest neighbors for PCA normal estimation [S1].
-- $T_w$: number of Weiszfeld iterations for center computation [S1].
